exports[`knowledge chat contracts > captures unselected, selected empty, messages and pending HTML > empty chat 1`] = `"<section open=""><article class="max-w-6xl w-[98vw] max-h-[95vh] flex flex-col p-0 gap-0"><header class="px-5 py-4 border-b border-border flex-shrink-0"><h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-base"><div class="w-6 h-6 bg-[#075E54] rounded-md flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square text-white"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg></div>知識ベース<span class="ml-auto text-xs font-normal text-muted-foreground">0件学習済み</span></h2><p class="text-xs">WhatsApp履歴・スクリーンショット・インボイスPDFをアップロードしてAIに学習させます</p></header><div class="flex border-b border-border flex-shrink-0"><button class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors border-b-2 border-transparent text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground">アップロード・管理</button><button class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors border-b-2 border-[#075E54] text-[#075E54]">AIチャット</button></div><div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto"><div class="flex" style="height:480px"><div class="w-52 flex-shrink-0 border-r border-border flex flex-col bg-muted/20"><div class="p-2 border-b border-border"><button class="w-full bg-[#075E54] hover:bg-[#075E54]/90 text-white gap-1.5 text-xs h-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>新規チャット</button></div><div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-1 space-y-0.5"><p class="text-[10px] text-muted-foreground text-center py-4">会話がありません</p></div></div><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col min-w-0"><div class="flex-1